msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we combine the like terms:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 10.348em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.211em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-